    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require family of those arrested for child sexual offences to be informed",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "I want a law to protect families who have a member of their family that has been arrested for child sexual offences but may not know about it. The law should state all close family members should be alerted instantly - guilty or not - so they can protect their children and any close friends.",
